\f1\fs26 The cops didn\'92t take Sarah and Cracker to a hospital. They took them to one each.\
They chauffeured Sarah to a palace in the sky where she would have access to the best care, including positive affirmation of her Airborne birthright. Cracker they rolled out of the cruiser onto a crumbling tenement clinic rooftop and left him there. Alexander agreed it would have to do.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl360\slmult1\partightenfactor0

