\f1\fs26 The flowers, fruit baskets, muffin hampers, lingerie, and menageries of plush teddy bears, bunny rabbits, unicorns and vibrators in Sarah\'92s medical suite were refreshed daily. All of the cards were signed identically:\
\pard\sl264\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::2>
\f3\i\fs26 \
Best wishes and get well soon\
I\'92m glad to have saved your life\
\'97Alexander Shakti
\f1\i0 \
\
